================================================================================
Upstream-derived and copied content in this repository
================================================================================

1. Reimplemented (derivative) source — Sources/DesignMD/**, Sources/CLI/**
   The DESIGN.md format specification, section model, `{path.to.token}`
   reference syntax, lint-rule semantics, color science, diff, and DTCG export
   shape originate from the upstream project and are REIMPLEMENTED in Swift
   here. These files are the author's own code (no upstream code is copied
   verbatim) and carry the author's copyright.

2. MODIFIED upstream file — Sources/DesignMD/Resources/spec.md
   Adapted from upstream docs/spec.md (Copyright 2026 Google LLC, Apache-2.0).
   Change: `pt` added to the list of valid dimension units for the Apple/SwiftUI
   edition. The file carries an in-file modification notice (Apache-2.0 §4b).

3. VERBATIM upstream copies — Tests/DesignMDTests/Fixtures/
   The following test fixtures are copied unmodified from upstream
   (Copyright 2026 Google LLC, Apache-2.0). The upstream files carry no
   copyright header; none is added here.
     atmospheric-glass.md  <- examples/atmospheric-glass/DESIGN.md
     paws-and-paths.md     <- examples/paws-and-paths/DESIGN.md
     totality-festival.md  <- examples/totality-festival/DESIGN.md
     HERITAGE.md           <- packages/cli/src/linter/fixtures/HERITAGE.md
     OUT_OF_ORDER.md       <- packages/cli/src/linter/fixtures/OUT_OF_ORDER.md
     NO_FRONTMATTER.md     <- packages/cli/src/linter/fixtures/NO_FRONTMATTER.md
   All other fixtures (apple-points.md, edge-*.md) and every *.golden.json are
   newly authored / tool-generated by this project.

   Also copied verbatim:
     examples/AtmosphericGlass/DESIGN.md  <- examples/atmospheric-glass/DESIGN.md
   Its generated Theme.swift and .xcassets are tool output of this project.

4. DERIVED documentation — docs/DESIGN-apple-swiftui.md
   An Apple/SwiftUI adaptation derived from the upstream README.md, docs/spec.md,
   and PHILOSOPHY.md. New prose by this project; concepts and structure from
   upstream.

================================================================================
Apple-platform additions (NOT part of upstream)
================================================================================

  - `pt` (points) accepted as a first-class dimension unit.
  - SwiftUI `Theme.swift` and Asset Catalog (`.xcassets`) exporters.
  - Several upstream parser bugs are not reproduced (e.g. CRLF handling).

The upstream `@google/design.md` npm package and the names "DESIGN.md" /
"Google" / "Google Labs" are referenced descriptively (nominative use) to
identify the origin of this port; no endorsement is implied.
